<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Centrica cut at SocGen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Centrica cut at SocGen.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centrica Plc, the natural gas distributor spun off from British Gas, was cut to &quot;overvalued&quot; from &quot;trading buy&quot; at SocGen, dealers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Analyst Irene Himona at SocGen said the downgrade reflected the recent strong performance by Centrica shares, which had passed her &quot;fair value&quot; target of 65p.</p>
<p>Centrica shares reached 82p on July 3, its highest since its market debut on February 9.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 17 1542 4367</p>
</text>
